<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>S&L Trucking LLC — Container Trucking · Pooler / Savannah, Georgia</title>
<meta name="description" content="S&L Trucking LLC is a container trucking company based in Pooler, Georgia, serving the Savannah area and the Southeast. USDOT 4227507 · MC-1639360.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
<style>
  .pub-top { background:#0f2a4a; color:#fff; padding:14px 18px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; }
  .pub-top .brand { font-size:20px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.3px; }
  .pub-top .brand small { display:block; font-size:12px; font-weight:400; color:#bcd; }
  .pub-top a.login-btn { background:#fff; color:#0f2a4a; font-weight:700; padding:9px 16px; border-radius:8px; text-decoration:none; }
  .pub-wrap { max-width:960px; margin:0 auto; padding:18px 14px 40px; }
  .hero { text-align:center; padding:30px 10px 8px; }
  .hero h1 { font-size:34px; margin:0 0 6px; color:#0f2a4a; }
  .hero p { font-size:17px; color:#445; margin:4px 0; }
  .svc { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:14px; }
  .svc .groupbox { flex:1 1 240px; margin:0; }
  .svc h3 { margin:2px 0 6px; color:#0f2a4a; }
  .cred { text-align:center; font-size:15px; padding:6px 0 0; }
  .hire { border:1.5px solid #2e7d32; background:#f2f8f2; border-radius:10px; padding:14px 16px; margin:16px 0; text-align:center; font-size:16px; }
  .pub-foot { text-align:center; color:#667; font-size:13px; padding:18px 10px 30px; }
  .hp { position:absolute; left:-9999px; width:1px; height:1px; overflow:hidden; }
  textarea { width:100%; min-height:110px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="pub-top">
  <div class="brand">S&amp;L Trucking LLC<small>Container Trucking · Pooler, Georgia</small></div>
  <a class="login-btn" href="/login">Staff Login</a>
</div>

<div class="pub-wrap">
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Container Trucking You Can Count On</h1>
    <p>Daily container moves in the Savannah area and across the Southeast.</p>
    <p>Business inquiries: <b>(213) 503-5668</b></p>
  </div>

  <div class="svc">
    <div class="groupbox">
      <h3>Container Transport</h3>
      <p>20 ft and 40 ft container moves between terminals, warehouses, and customer sites — import and export, loaded and empty.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="groupbox">
      <h3>Reefer &amp; Genset</h3>
      <p>Refrigerated container moves with genset service, handled by drivers trained on temperature-controlled freight.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="groupbox">
      <h3>Regional Coverage</h3>
      <p>Based in Pooler, Georgia — serving the Savannah area daily, with regional runs across Georgia and the Southeast.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
    <h2>About S&amp;L Trucking</h2>
    <p>S&amp;L Trucking LLC is a container trucking company based in Pooler, Georgia. Our company tractors and professional drivers run container freight in the Savannah area every day, and our dispatch runs on a simple rule: every load is tracked from the order to the empty return, and every driver gets home daily.</p>
    <p class="cred"><b>USDOT 4227507</b> · <b>MC-1639360</b> · Licensed &amp; insured · Pooler, Georgia</p>
  </div>

<div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
    <h2>Now Hiring — CDL-A Drivers</h2>
    <p style="font-size:17px"><b>$1,800 – $2,500 per week</b> on full weeks · <b>Home daily</b> · Settled every Friday</p>
    <div class="svc">
      <div class="groupbox">
        <h3>What we offer</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Home daily — company pays your truck parking, so park near your home</li>
          <li>Occupational accident (Occ/Acc) coverage provided</li>
          <li>14 vacation days a year (7 paid)</li>
          <li>$700 birthday bonus · $1,000 Thanksgiving bonus</li>
          <li>Fuel card and company card provided</li>
          <li>Your pay share rises to 55% after your first year</li>
          <li>Weekend premium pay at 70%</li>
          <li>Company tractors — no truck payment, no lease-purchase</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="groupbox">
        <h3>What you need</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Valid CDL-A and a current DOT medical card</li>
          <li>TWIC card — or able to get one</li>
          <li>A driving record we can insure: no DUI, no Clearinghouse prohibition</li>
          <li>Pass a pre-employment drug test (federal requirement)</li>
          <li>Container or port experience is a plus — not required</li>
        </ul>
        <p><b>To apply:</b> leave your name, phone, and a few lines about your experience in the message form below. We read every message.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" id="contact">
    <h2>Leave a Message</h2>
    <% if (typeof sent !== 'undefined' && sent) { %>
    <div class="alert">Thank you — your message has been received. We will get back to you shortly.</div>
    <% } %>
    <form method="POST" action="/contact">
      <div class="form-row">
        <div><label>Your name</label><input name="name" required maxlength="120"></div>
        <div><label>Phone or email</label><input name="contact" required maxlength="160"></div>
      </div>
      <div><label>Message</label><textarea name="message" required maxlength="2000"></textarea></div>
      <div class="hp"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div>
      <div style="margin-top:12px"><button type="submit">Send message</button></div>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="pub-foot">© 2026 S&amp;L Trucking LLC · Pooler, Georgia · USDOT 4227507 · MC-1639360</div>
</body>
</html>
